gdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scy4k5.jpg"}, {"id": 1592215, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scy4k7.jpg"}, {"id": 1592216, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scy4k8.jpg"}], "slug": "lord-monarch--1", "storyline": "You are prince Alfred, the son of the great king of Monarch. Since you have been a rather fresh and lazy boy, the king decides to strengthen you by sending you to battle. You are now sixteen, and you must prove you are worthy of being the prince of Monarch!", "summary": "The Super Famicom version of Lord Monarch additional themes in addition to the medieval Europe theme. There is a futuristic theme with robots, a fast food theme with French fries and soft drinks attacking health food, a Three Kingdoms era theme, and a fairy-tale theme. The game is automatically paused until someone presses the Start button, so there is unlimited time for making alliances in the Super Famicom version\u2014until the start button is pressed.\n\nThe Super Famicom version of Lord Monarch was one of the few games to support the Super Famicom mouse.\n\nA later version of the game was broadcast exclusively for Japanese markets via the Super Famicom's Satellaview subunit under the name BS Lord Monarch and was view-limited.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/lord-monarch--1", "videos": [{"id": 157061, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "GRdgSn1kdaU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GRdgSn1kdaU", "title": "\u3010SFC\u3011\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u30e2\u30ca\u30fc\u30af\uff08LordMonarch\uff09\u3092\u666e\u901a\u306b\u653b\u7565\u3000part1\u3000\u300c\u541b\u4e3b\u7d99\u627f\u6226\u300d", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GRdgSn1kdaU/hqdefault.jpg"}]}